{"id": "14-2944-2-5", "zh": "“**有时**”是为了什么？", "confidence": 80}
{"id": "14-2944-6-9", "zh": "例如 mahīyati、mathīyati。", "confidence": 80}
{"id": "14-2945-2-10", "zh": "522，476．isu、yamu 的末音可变为 ccha。", "confidence": 80}
{"id": "14-2946-2-11", "zh": "isu、yamu 这些词根的末音可以变为 ccha。", "confidence": 85}
{"id": "14-2946-12-15", "zh": "例如 icchati、niyacchati。", "confidence": 85}
{"id": "14-2947-2-5", "zh": "“**或**”是为了什么？", "confidence": 75}
{"id": "14-2947-6-9", "zh": "例如 esati、niyamati。", "confidence": 85}
{"id": "14-2948-2-10", "zh": "523，526．使役词缀的 ṇ 脱落。", "confidence": 80}
{"id": "14-2949-2-6", "zh": "称为使役（kārita）的这些词缀，其 ṇ 会脱落。", "confidence": 80}
{"id": "14-2950-2-9", "zh": "例如 kāreti、kārayati、kārāpeti、kārāpayati。", "confidence": 85}
{"id": "14-2951-2-7", "zh": "为了教法而提出，我已简要地讲述了动词篇；", "confidence": 75}
{"id": "14-2952-2-7", "zh": "有识之士们，请以自己卓越的智慧去思考。", "confidence": 75}
{"id": "14-2953-2-6", "zh": "以上是动词篇的第四章。", "confidence": 90}
{"id": "14-2954-2-4", "zh": "动词篇结束。", "confidence": 90}
